# Usuarios — Create / Update / Delete (JWT + RBAC)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@id = 2

### LoginAdmin
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sesion/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "admin",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}
